# Thank You Girl, refrain ending in the later refrains: Paul's added upper part (figure 16.6)
# In the first bar they sing in unison; in the second Paul splits off above John's tune, a fourth
# then fourth then fifth above. Notes share each bar equally.
#? Register: placed to match fig. 16.4 (John's tune ending on A4); may lie an octave lower.
key D

system
voice "Paul"   | E5 D5 D5 | F#5 E5 E5 |
voice "John"   | E5 D5 D5 | C#5 B4 A4 |
